FYI this issue is related to the serialization of the object to JSON before applying the second mutation.

The first mutation will set the value to an empty list, however during serialization of the object for the second mutation the value of `initContainers` will be omitted as it is marked as `omitempty` in the `PodSpec` type.

An alternative would be to use an `ApplyConfiguration` with something similar to the following expression

```
Object {
  spec: Object.spec {
    template: Object.spec.template {
      spec: Object.spec.template.spec {
        initContainers: object.spec.template.spec.?initContainers.orValue([]) + [
          Object.spec.template.spec.initContainers {
            name: "mesh-proxy",
            image: "mesh/proxy:v1.0.0",
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```

